<overview>
<p>The Taurian Defense Force assigns conventional infantry to garrison and planetary defense roles across the Concordat, where citizen-soldiers serve out of patriotic duty rather than mere obligation. Foot platoons form the garrison backbone of the TDF's infantry arm, cheap to equip and maintain on worlds where the Concordat's limited resources must stretch across dozens of systems. Since infantry regiments rarely rotate offworld, many battalions train as specialists in local terrain, and anti-BattleMech training is standard for all formations at battalion strength or greater.</p><p>Armed with standard ballistic assault rifles, the most common and affordable infantry weapon in the Inner Sphere, these platoons deliver reliable short-range firepower and can be equipped and resupplied from almost any garrison stockpile.</p>
</overview>

